# The Tauri CLI re-serialises src-tauri/Cargo.toml (toml_edit) at every `tauri build`/`tauri dev` and writes it with
# LF line endings. A CRLF checkout (core.autocrlf=true, the Git for Windows and GitHub windows runner default) would
# then show Cargo.toml as modified after every build, and the release workflow refuses a changed checkout.
src-tauri/Cargo.toml text eol=lf
